WEBVTT

00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:13,700
Is it possible to not need to run my cancer program every night?

00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:19,940
I know. I am sensitive to too much detox at one time past experience that taught me.

00:00:20,420 --> 00:00:24,180
Of course, I won't need to do everything I can to keep the cancer at bay.

00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:29,220
Yeah, I mean, if your cancer isn't like glowy right now,

00:00:29,220 --> 00:00:33,380
and you want to run a different program tonight for some other reason,

00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:36,100
then by all means, yeah, run something else for sure.

